WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.640
We are going to the dentist. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:10.776
We sit in the waiting room until the dentist calls our name.

3
00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:16.800
We sit in the big special chair. It can move up and down.

4
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.528
We open our mouth wide, like a sleepy lion.

5
00:00:21.528 --> 00:00:26.760
The dentist counts our teeth with a small mirror and a light.

6
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:33.456
Sometimes a little tool sprays water and air. It does not hurt.

7
00:00:33.456 --> 00:00:38.328
When the dentist says finished, we rinse with water.

8
00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:44.328
All done. We get to choose a sticker, and we go home.

9
00:00:44.328 --> 00:00:52.536
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

